# Build-context trimming for the root (Hugging Face Space) image. That build's
# context is the repo root and it bundles only backend/, so keep the 800 MB+ dev
# virtualenv, caches, and VCS metadata out — they'd bloat the image and bust the
# layer cache on every change. (Does not affect the compose builds, whose
# context is ./backend or ./frontend.)
.git/
.gitignore
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
.env
.env.*

# Not part of the single-container API image (the API + workers live in backend/)
frontend/
fine_tuning/
graph_seed/
scripts/
docs/
*.md
